 "bubble.hearthholm.idle.0": "Nice weather today.",
 "bubble.hearthholm.idle.1": "%1$s is a good place to live.",
 "bubble.hearthholm.idle.2": "I wonder what is for supper.",
 "bubble.hearthholm.idle.3": "Hmm hmm hmm...",
 "bubble.hearthholm.idle.4": "Did you see that cloud?",
 "bubble.hearthholm.idle.5": "Just taking a breath.",
